Mr. Naoto Arase, Chief Financial Officer of Golden FX Link Capital, gave a presentation to make it easy for participants to understand and invest in derivative products, prevention and mitigation of investment risk and best strategies to extract. Better return on investment.
Mr. Naoto also expressed the company's commitment to continue to develop the derivatives market in Cambodia as well as other developed countries.
