Nearly 7 million tons of Cambodia's agricultural products to be exported to international markets in 2019
(Phnom Penh): The Minister of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries, Mr. Veng Sakhon, on the first day of 2020, presented the official figures recorded by the Ministry on the export of Cambodia's agricultural products in 2019.
According to the Minister's report, in 2019, Cambodia exported nearly 7 million tons of agricultural products, both formal and informal, to foreign markets, of which nearly 5 million tons were officially exported and more than 2 million tons were unofficial. .
Informal rice exports: In 2019, Cambodia exported more than 2 million tons of informal rice to Vietnam through border provinces such as Takeo, Prey Veng, Svay Rieng, Kandal and Kampot.
The main markets for Cambodia's agricultural products are: China, Europe, ASEAN, Japan, the United States, Korea, India, Russia, Saudi Arabia, Australia and so on.
The crisis of war led to the people falling into the abyss of the abyss of the Democratic Kampuchea regime of the genocidal regime of Pol Pot, Ieng Sary, Khieu Samphan, Nuon Chea since 17 April 1975, abolishing all rights, freedoms and the right to life. The life of the people for 3 years, 8 months and 20 days is known only as misery, never known as happiness.
January 7, 1979 - After liberating the lives of the Cambodian people from the brutal regime, the Cambodian people are still suffering because of poverty and hunger. The lives of the Cambodian people began to rise with a better life after the end of the Cambodian war on December 29, 1998.
The end of the 21-year-old war has provided a full opportunity for the Royal Government to formulate policies to restore the country's development, attract investors to invest and create jobs for the people. Along with attracting investors, Cambodia has also opened up the market for more overseas products for its goods.
Economic growth has also pushed people's lives better, with people living below the poverty line now numbering about 10 percent. While the annual income of a citizen is more than 1816 US dollars.
As people's lives improve, so do people's livelihoods. After living and learning from the genocidal regime of Pol Pot, Cambodians celebrate the New Year and Pchum Ben only.
But now, whether it is New Year, Pchum Ben or Chinese New Year and other festivals, there are always gatherings and trips. Another festival that should be noted is the New Year, the Global New Year, which is a traditional tradition of the people in the West, is now being celebrated in Cambodia.
In particular, people who do not have a trip outside, they also gather with family, relatives, eat, sing and have fun until late at night to welcome the new year.
These pleasures may not be possible if Cambodia has no peace, no political stability, and the living standards of its people are not good.
Overall, the "peace" that has dominated Cambodia for 21 years is the most important suffix that brings about a change in life, a change of life, a life full of happiness and peace. Thank you for the peace that has led to prosperity, prosperity and happiness.
