By 2019, more than 1 million passengers will be transported by Lan My Airlines
(Phnom Penh): Lan My Airlines has transported more than 1 million passengers this year, making Lan Mi the first airline in Cambodia to achieve its goal of transporting 1 million passengers in One year.
On December 31, 2019, with flight LQ996 departing from Sihanoukville International Airport, Lan My Airlines broke Cambodia's civil aviation record by carrying 1.2 million passengers in one year.
The success of this tourist transport coincided with the two-year anniversary of the Lan My Airlines operation on September 29, 2019.
With deep gratitude, in 2020, Lan My Airlines is committed to providing better services to passengers and the public. Lan My Airlines will strive to create a unique brand and strive to develop the company to be a leader in the aviation tourism industry in the Kingdom of Cambodia.
