Sophea Maternity Hospital opens a new location to continue to improve care and treatment for people
(Phnom Penh): In order to continue to improve the care and treatment of the people, especially maternal and child health, Sophea Maternity Hospital has now expanded and opened another new branch, Sophea Meanchey Maternity Polyclinic, located at # 67. Samdech Monireth Blvd, Sangkat Steung Meanchey 2, Khan Meanchey, Phnom Penh.
Sophea Maternity Hospital, which is a leader in providing 24-hour medical services in preventive care and treatment services, has been operating since 1992, with highly qualified professors and doctors with many years of experience who have graduated from abroad and in the country. There are service staff who respect the ethics of the health profession with virtue and ethics.
Sophea Maternity Hospital is equipped with the latest medical equipment in accordance with national and international standards and the hospital management and operation system with high quality and efficiency.
Prof. Dr. Pech Sothy, Director of Sophea Meanchey Maternity Polyclinic, said: Sophea Meanchey Maternity provides prenatal and postnatal care services, consulting, general medicine, pediatric and neonatal surgery by experienced specialists. Many years.
In addition, Sophea Meanchey Polyclinic also provides ultrasound services for pregnant women, heart disease, newborns. The room is spacious, clean and comfortable. The new branch has been operating since July 2019 and was officially inaugurated in December 2019.
"People will receive warm, virtuous and trustworthy care from Sophea Meanchey Polyclinic, which focuses on quality, efficiency and safety," he said.
Please be informed that Sophea Maternity Hospital Branch has Sophea 1 Maternity Hospital, Sophea Maternity VIP and Sophea Gold Maternity Hospital located in Sangkat Veal Vong, Khan 7 Makara, Phnom Penh. Sophea Meanchey Maternity Polyclinic is located in Sangkat Steung Meanchey, Khan Meanchey. A military officer denies allegations of encroachment on land in Anlong Veng district and dares to face the law if found guilty
