(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation has organized the distribution of tablets to the Department of Social Affairs and the Capital-Provincial Planning Department to continue to distribute to 1646 communes throughout the country to implement cash subsidies for pregnant women and children Under 2 in poor families now.
The distribution ceremony was attended by Mr. Vong Soth, Minister of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation and civil servants of the Ministry of Social Affairs, representatives of UNICEF, the Director of the Capital-Provincial Department of Social Affairs and the Director of the Planning Department, as well as many other stakeholders.
