Ms. Khieu Borey added that based on the National Social Protection Policy Framework (2016-2025), the Royal Government has transferred the implementation of cash support programs for pregnant women and children under 2 years of age from the Ministry of Health to the Ministry of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation to manage and implement cash support for pregnant women and children under 2 years old from January 2020 onwards.
At the capital-provincial level, there are the capital-provincial administration, the Department of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation, and the provincial-capital health departments, and at the commune / sangkat level, there are commune / sangkat administrations and public health facilities.
