The 11th project of the new Phnom Penh Borey is built on a total area of about 25 hectares with a total of nearly 1,000 houses, including apartments, hybrid villas, twin villas, queen villas and king villas. Not only that, the company also has a plot of land measuring 20 meters x 30 meters for sale to customers who need to build a house or villa to their liking.
