This statement was made by Samdech Picheay Sena on the afternoon of December 26, 2019, on the occasion that Samdech presided over the closing ceremony of the meeting to summarize the work results of the Armed Forces in 2019 and disseminate the direction of the army in 2020. Royal Gendarmerie across the country.
Samdech Pichey Sena Tea Banh said: "The most dangerous problem, we must all remember this drug is very dangerous, it penetrates into the area, especially the light of some people. "It attracts groups and channels, and if these people are already addicted or addicted to drugs, it is easy for some bad environment to attract them."
"The drug problem, it may be near us and there may be some places with us more, this is a dangerous thing, some problems it already has, but we have worked with the trust of the government to work, such as forestry, to prevent Take a big step. This is the confirmation of Samdech Pichey Sena Tea Banh.
The Cambodian Minister of National Defense added that drug crimes are criminals who use all tricks to traffic in Cambodia, requiring all professional forces to work hard, especially not to neglect drug offenses, both intellectual and intellectual ability. Skills and patriotism of the people.
Meanwhile, Samdech Pichey Sena Tea Banh said: "The situation in Cambodia remains interesting, including: deforestation, illegal timber exports, drugs, wildlife exports. "Illegal wildlife, encroachment on state land, illegal mining, gambling, illegal mobilization, disasters, traffic accidents, fires and other cases."
