Anti-Drug Department: Arrest of people in front of Ponhea Krek Primary School, Russey Keo District as a drug crackdown, 3 suspects were arrested
(Phnom Penh): After posting a video on Facebook involving a group of people in front of Ponhea Krek Primary School in Russey Keo district on the night of December 25, 2019, seeing the arrests. On December 27, 2019, the Anti-Drug Department of the General Commission of the National Police came out to clarify this case as a crackdown on drug crimes and three suspects were arrested.
The Anti-Drug Department has fully clarified this case:
The Anti-Drug Department would like to clarify to the media and the public the case on the night of December 25, 2019 at around 11:40 am is a case of drug crime, not a case of arresting anarchists, threatening to take money. Yes, as the owner of the Facebook account "Do Not Care" mentioned.
Seeing such a bad situation, the police were forced to use hot measures to lift the perpetrator onto a motorbike from the scene so as not to surprise and disturb the people's sleep even more.
As for the gun that the police hold in their hands, the police prevent it in any case, lest there be a situation where we can not predict that the perpetrators do not have weapons to defend themselves, any other night, how do we know that the perpetrators can be together How many more people are waiting to protect each other? At this point, please, as well as the journalists, please understand.
You have the right to express your opinion and record videos, but please use this right well, targeted and limited, otherwise exercising those rights will cause more difficulties on our authority and it turns out to be Profits to the perpetrators from the perpetrators to the victims, while our authorities become the perpetrators and make people hate.
As for the target at the entrance to the river, the police raided but the perpetrators were always ready, meaning that they (the perpetrators) acted (distributing illegal drugs) carefully, just seeing our police motorcycles, they (the perpetrators) ran away. Jumping over the fence, jumping into the river, disappearing due to the complex geography and narrow passages, and even at night, making it difficult for the police to arrest any, the authorities should also consider personal security.
Please, the general public, please be aware and do not be confused as a civilian who pretends to be a competent person to extort money or extort money, and please understand our authority that you work hard to serve the people and the public, regardless of Night and day to provide security and order as well as protect the safety of the people.
Therefore, please, journalists and our people, please do not rush to judge the incident, but on the pictures at the scene, immediately understand that arresting people, especially the perpetrators, is not easy, no perpetrators stand We remain silent for the authorities to handcuff us, and we can not predict that the perpetrators do not have weapons, so every time the authorities must be ready to defend themselves, it is a response to any reaction of The perpetrator.
Currently, the above three suspects, the Department is building a case and exhibits to the Prosecutor of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court to deal with according to law.
The Anti-Drug Department welcomes all constructive comments and criticisms to improve the exaggeration, slander, and defamation of the National Police. Absolutely acceptable.
