It should also be reminded that at 12 midnight on December 25, 2019, a man died suddenly under a mango tree in front of his house after the other party chased him. Along 1988 Street in Sangkat Phnom Penh Thmey, Khan Sen Sok, Phnom Penh.
After the incident, several of the victims were called in for questioning by police to find clues to the other side of the conflict.
