"It is the most heinous act that has ever happened to a happy family of four, including eight-year-olds and 11-year-olds, who were killed for personal gain," she said.
Currently, 120 prisoners have been sentenced to death and are awaiting execution in Japan, and in 2018, 15 prisoners were executed. The execution of Wei Wei, a Chinese national, was the 39th execution of a prisoner under the government of Japanese Prime Minister Abhisit Vejjajiva. Prior to 2007, the identities of executioners were not disclosed or disclosed on the death penalty data.
Mr. Soy Kosal was elected by the General Assembly as the President of the National League of Local Councils for the Third Mandate.
(Phnom Penh): On December 26, 2019, the National League of Associations of Municipal, District, Khan, Commune and Sangkat Councils called the National League of Local Councils organized the third general assembly by electing Mr. Soy Kosal, currently a member of Khan Council. Russey Keo to continue as chairman for another 5 years.
Mr. Soy Kosal was elected President of the National League for the first time in 2006, then the National League of Communes and Sangkats and the second time in 2014 as the President of the National League of Associations of Municipal, District, Khan, Commune and Sangkat Councils.
The opening ceremony of the General Assembly was presided over by Mr. Sak Setha, Permanent Secretary of State of the Ministry of Interior, representing Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Interior.
A total of 470 participants attended the General Assembly, including 320 delegates from municipal, district, Khan, commune and sangkat councils from eight political parties.
The National League of Local Councils was established to promote the capacity development and protection of the legitimate interests of municipal councils, district councils, district councils and commune councils across the country. $ 700 million to build a luxury Borey on a total area of 7.7 hectares, 60 meters from the road
