Man Arrested on Court Order in Kandal Province
(Kandal): The police force of Ang Snoul District Inspector arrested a man on the order of Kandal Provincial Court on charges of "using violence against a real estate occupant in good faith".
Mr. Thach Sovanna, Chief of Criminal Division of Ang Snoul District, said that the execution of the above arrest warrant was made on December 25, 2019 at the house of Mok Bay, Prey Kor Village, Lumhach Commune, Ang Snoul District, Kandal Province.
Mr. Thach Sovanna said that the suspect, Chan Chon, 44 years old, farmer, resided in Tuol Serey village, Tuol Prich commune, Ang Snoul district, Kandal province. He was arrested on a warrant issued on December 16, 2019 by Investigating Judge Huot Heang of Kandal Provincial Court.
