On that occasion, Samdech Techo Hun Sen also expressed his hope that the Cambodian products that have been exhibited in Phnom Penh, as well as the exhibition of our Cambodian products on the Sea Festival in Kampot recently, hope that all those products Will become a commodity flowing into Vietnam as well.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen added that in the future, Cambodian mangoes, bananas, durians and other commodities will be able to be supplied in the Vietnamese market, where Vietnamese people are now meeting their daily needs. As well as supplying millions of tourists.
