According to the CamControl Svay Rieng branch, the responsibility for food safety is a joint responsibility of professional institutions, importers, producers, distributors and all consumers, because health is the main factor of health. Survival of human life.
After inspecting many items in the market, they found defective goods, including butter, tapioca and tofu, a total of 80 cans were burned and the seller agreed to stop selling defective goods. Out of date because they all understand the impact on people's health.
Svay Rieng CamControl officials called on all people to be careful when eating food, to check the date label clearly before buying to eat.
In particular, the food that children like to eat must be checked properly before eating to participate in promoting the well-being of all, and CamControl officials will continue to inspect the goods in the markets in Svay Rieng province.
