Remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the Occasion of the Inauguration of the Cambodia-Vietnam Commodity Exchange, the First Market on the Cambodia-Vietnam Border
(Tbong Khmum): The first Cambodia-Vietnam Commodity Exchange on the Cambodia-Vietnam border was inaugurated on Tuesday, March 13, 2019.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he was very pleased to be inaugurated the Cambodian Border Model Market.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he was very happy to come to the hot former battlefield area during the 1970s. Especially between 1970 and 1972, before the withdrawal of US and South Vietnamese troops.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Cambodian border model market will facilitate the business of people along the border between the two countries legally.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the trade volume between Cambodia and Vietnam is more than 4,800 million US dollars.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the population of nearly 100 million is a market for Cambodian products.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he was very pleased with Vietnam's economic progress in recent years.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he told the Vietnamese side that he was concerned about the economic situation of Vietnam and Thailand. Samdech Techo said that if the Vietnamese and Thai economies decline, it will also affect the Cambodian economy.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that this Cambodian border model market will become a model market for promoting trade between Cambodia and Vietnam.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the establishment of the Cambodian Border Model Market is in response to Samdech's two goals: to turn the former battlefield into a market and to develop and transform the border area with all neighboring countries into a border area. Friendship, peace and cooperation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that the border area of 7 palm trees in Dar commune, Memot district was a former fierce battlefield with the South Vietnamese and US troops.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that this border area is a very hot battlefield and the battle is not with the Khmer, but with South Vietnam and the United States from May 1, 1970, which is the day the US and Vietnamese troops Tbong enters National Road 7 from Snuol district to Tonle Bit.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Royal Government is turning all border areas into areas of peace, friendship, cooperation and development.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the people in the border area are no longer afraid, so the pace of development must be accelerated.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that people need a market and we need to promote product processing for export.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen urges Vietnam to increase its purchases from Cambodia, because currently the trade balance between Cambodia and Vietnam is very different.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in the past, Cambodia and Vietnam shelled each other, but now shelled each other.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the introduction of the trade market between Cambodia and Vietnam is one of the successes of Samdech's policy after the successful implementation of the win-win policy.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the official trade volume between Cambodia and Vietnam is more than 4,600 million dollars, but the informal trade volume can reach 5 billion dollars.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that customs and immigration officials must not cause any disturbance to the people who do business at the Cambodian border model market.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that disturbing the business of the people will lead to business in the corridor, leading to illegal trade, including drugs.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen told the Tbong Khmum provincial governor that if the border model market collapses, the position of the provincial governor will also be removed.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in the last 41 years, the border line between Cambodia and Vietnam has become a peaceful border line, while the former is in conflict due to the US-backed South Vietnamese aggression.
