The ceremony of Samdech Techo Hun Sen was held on December 22, 2019 at the closing ceremony of the meeting of the Mass Movement Committee of the Central Committee of the Cambodian People's Party in Koh Pich.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed his deep gratitude to the members of the Cambodian People's Party throughout the country as well as the members of the People's Movement of the Central Committee of the People's Party for participating in achieving many great achievements for the motherland.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen wrote on Facebook: "Obviously, in all circumstances, the CPP is always close to the people and strives to strengthen solidarity and gather all resources to promote development and defense of the motherland. Moving forward. At the same time, we must continue to participate in maintaining peace and political and social stability so that Cambodia has more opportunities to develop the country.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen also stated that because the party has the right path and gives full freedom to the people so far, only the Cambodian People's Party has the support of people from all walks of life. There is also the participation of members of various political parties, which makes the CPP stronger and continues to win elections and grow.
On that occasion, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party, reminded party officials, especially officials who have the role of serving the Royal Government to continue to serve the people to receive public services, including services. Necessary needs and services, as well as accepting requests from people to increase the trust and warmth of the people.
Before concluding, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the People's Party, wished all party leaders good health and new successes in the mission to serve the country and serve the people for the benefit. More and more under the mandate of the CPP. Ministry of Posts organizes first online recruitment competition within the ministry
