Please be reminded that on the morning of May 27, 2019, the police of Sen Sok district sent the mother and daughter who killed the husband and son-in-law, Kim Yot, 29 years old, to the Phnom Penh Municipal Court to send According to the law, both men later pleaded guilty.
On this case, Colonel Ho Meng Wang, Sen Sok District Police Inspector, once told Fresh News reporters that after hearing about the murder, his authorities immediately went to the scene to check and record the case file. Under the coordination of Mr. Riel Sophin, Deputy Prosecutor of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court.
In connection with the murder, the police said that the mother and daughter killed the husband and son-in-law, first cut and tied the hands and feet with scotch tape, then stabbed to death more because But they are afraid of the victims. After that, they came to confess, so the two perpetrators (mother and daughter) were arrested by Sen Sok district police on May 25, 2019.
According to the confession of the two murderers, it started from a money dispute until they conspired to kill each other. According to the confession, the couple got married on January 26, 2019 and came to rent a house. At around 9 am on May 24, 2019, the wife, Ngoy Somary, asked her husband for 10,000 riel, and the husband refused, so there was a verbal dispute that resulted in violence between the mother and her child, who stabbed the victim to death. .
