Prosecutors decide to charge Soum Savy in connection with fraud case victim
Court officials say prosecutors have decided to charge Soum Savy with fraud, and the case is pending before Judge Slina.
It should be noted that on the morning of December 21, 2019, the accused named Soum Savy was sent to the Phnom Penh Municipal Court by the Phnom Penh Municipal Police to be handed over to the Prosecutor's Office for investigation and indictment. By law.
The transfer of the suspect took place after the Phnom Penh Municipal Police's light criminal police force on December 20, 2019 arrested a man named Soum Savy for cheating a victim while there were reports that The intervention also wants to run for the scammer's release.
The arrest of the swindler was made on the arrest warrant issued by Mr. Long Cheab, Deputy Prosecutor of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court on December 17, 2019, for questioning on the "fraud" case in Phnom Penh. Phnom Penh during 2018 to 2019 according to the complaint of M. Ly dated October 08, 2019.
The scammer, 31-year-old Soum Savy, currently lives at 27, Street 2, Borey Phnom Penh Thmey, Poung Peay Village, Sangkat Toul Sangke II, Khan Russey Keo.
At this time, the suspect is being investigated by Ms. Slina, Investigating Judge of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court.
