(Phnom Penh): Mr. Steng Manit, Sangkat Chief of Kilometer 6, is accused of ordering machinery to clear and repair the road without prior notice and using inappropriate words as a leader, which caused damage to his garden and house. Residents live in a group in the fourth group, Spean Khpos village, Sangkat Kilometer 6, Khan Russey Keo on the afternoon of December 21, 2019 yesterday.
