We will lose the safety of big businessmen, big businessmen who are rich, do not dare to come to Cambodia for fear of the Maya, so whatever has to be paid, we are willing not to go online, but we will definitely bring Our country is secure and we bring in honest investors and wealthy investors to live in Cambodia.
Conversely, if the online presence continues, Cambodia will become a victim and the first victim is our security, then the next will be the target of money laundering, which the world is fighting against money laundering. Dirty money as well as terrorism Financing for terrorism is a danger point. So there are only a few days left to completely disappear from Cambodia.
Separately, another issue related to the decline of the construction sector, Samdech Techo Hun Sen emphasized that the construction sector in Cambodia is not only for online games, if they stop renting houses or buildings should take the location to do other business because of anything. There must be a fee.
What Samdech Techo Hun Sen emphasized is the closure of the online game business so that Cambodia does not become a haven for foreign criminals who engage in fraudulent activities to extort money from victims both inside and outside the country, which undermines security and order. Public and social order.
In the circular, the government has made the following three recommendations:
1. Judicial police officers and competent authorities at all levels must increase the research and suppression of electronic gambling business through the Internet, all kinds of domestic and foreign, and all forms of activities without a license from the competent ministry. .
2. For the business of electronic gambling through the Internet, online, domestic and foreign licensed to operate until the expiration of the license. After this, the Ministry of Economy and Finance will not renew the license to operate this type of gambling business.
3. The Royal Government ceases to provide policies and licenses for the operation of electronic betting business via the Internet, both inside and outside the Kingdom of Cambodia from the date of signing this circular. Check out the main gallery of international events on December 21, 2019! (Photo inside)
