The Space Force is the first new U.S. military unit to be established in more than seven decades, dating back to 1947, and is the sixth U.S. military unit after the Army, Navy, Air Force, and Marine Corps. , And the Coast Guard. The Space Force was formed from the Space Command, which has been operating under the auspices of the Air Force since its inception last August.
According to the NDAA, out of the $ 738 billion military budget, $ 40 million will be used to build the space force, but that is less than the $ 72.4 million budget initially proposed by the Pentagon, while some US lawmakers remain. Doubts about the need for additional military units, leading to higher defense spending.
The creation of a US space force is meaningful enough for the world to understand, as more and more countries have the capability to launch satellites into space, as well as ambitions to build their own space stations, such as China and India. And Russia and so on. Analysts have already said that the US space force is no different from any other military unit, which was created to maintain US supremacy in all areas.
