Bavet City Deputy Inspector Keo Chetra, nearly 30 years old, the son of Bavet City Police Inspector Keo Kong, last night fired two shots, one at the top and the other at the shop owner. This case happened in Samnang Ane Music Restaurant in Tapov Village, Bavet Sangkat, Bavet City, Svay Rieng Province.
