Two killed, five injured in cement truck overturning in Samsung
(Kampong Chhnang): Two people were killed and five others were seriously injured in a traffic accident caused by a car. The incident happened at 10:30 pm on December 20, 2019 on National Road 5 between km 120 and 121 in Ang village, Popel commune, Baribo district, Kampong Chhnang province.
Traffic police said that when they arrived at the scene, a full collision caused the death of a man immediately at the scene and another driver of a Samsung car was seriously injured and died of asphyxiation. The five injured are being treated at the Kampong Chhnang Provincial Referral Hospital.
In the accident, a cement truck swerved into the right side of the road while the Samsung truck almost crashed into the road.
After the accident, the driver of the cement truck caused the accident and fled, leaving the car at the scene. Separately, the two vehicles were taken to be stored at the Police Inspectorate Boribo district waiting to deal with the procedure later.
