HKL staffs in Siem Reap donate blood under the theme "Donate blood to save lives and give love"
(Siem Reap): More than 70 employees of Hattha Kaksekar Microfinance Institution Limited from its branch offices in Siem Reap this morning, December 21, 2019, donated blood under the theme "Blood Donation to Save Lives and Give love.
The event took place at the Siem Reap Provincial Blood Transfusion Center, located in the Siem Reap Provincial Referral Hospital, with the participation of the Director of the Siem Reap Provincial Health Department, the Director and staff of the Provincial Referral Hospital, as well as the branch director and staff of HKL. In Siem Reap.
The blood donation of HKL staff today clearly demonstrates the active participation in social responsibility activities with care, love and participation for the benefit of the community and society.
Dr. Pen Phalkun, Director of Siem Reap Provincial Referral Hospital, expressed his pleasure to see that the staff of Hattha Kaksekar Microfinance Institution Limited has initiated this event.
He said, "I am very happy that HKL team has volunteered to donate blood at the Siem Reap Provincial Referral Hospital today, and the donated blood will save the lives of patients in time because The Siem Reap Provincial Referral Hospital will donate blood immediately if the patient needs it urgently and urgently, without having to find people to donate for a change. ”
Dr. Kros Sarath, Director of Siem Reap Provincial Health Department, also expressed his interest in opening the program by appreciating the teachers who are HKL staff for the encouragement and harmony to donate blood to save lives and give love now.
He added that blood donation provides three major benefits: first: helping donors stay healthy, second: saving lives, and third: participating in important social activities. Money can not buy life, but a drop of blood can save lives, he added.
Please note that Hattha Kaksekar Limited has more than 25 years of experience in providing financial services in Cambodia. Hattha Kaksekar Limited currently has 176 branch offices to provide credit, savings, local money transfer, payroll and mobile banking services to customers, as well as 129 ATMs across 25 provinces / cities in Cambodia.
Samdech Techo Prime Minister also said that this evening, Samdech will attend the Sea Festival in Kampot. Samdech Techo Hun Sen also wished his compatriots happiness and a happy weekend together.
