Samdech Say Chhum Asks to Pay Attention to the Role of Mass Organizations and Mass Movement as Important CPP Aid
(Phnom Penh): On December 21, 2019, the Mass Movement Committee of the Central Committee of the Cambodian People's Party (CPP) held its annual meeting under the chairmanship of Samdech Vibol Sena Pheakdey Say Chhum, Vice Chairman of the Party and Chairman of the Standing Committee. Standing Committee of the Central Committee of the Cambodian People's Party.
As a message to the meeting, Samdech Vibol Sena Pheakdey Say Chhum recommended to the meeting to pay attention to discuss the role of mass organizations and mass movements that play an important role as party assistants to be strong. Adhere to the party's guiding principles.
Samdech Vibol Sena Pheakdey also instructed the meeting to work the masses regularly and thoroughly and connect with the masses closely.
On this occasion, Ms. Men Sam An, President of the Mass Movement Committee, spoke about the role of the Mass Movement Committee in assessing the public consciousness, grasping the needs as well as their necessary requests to give opinions to the party.
She also mentioned the achievements of the mass committee in the past year. Mr. HUN Many, Secretary General of the Mass Movement Committee, read out the progress report of the Mass Movement Committee of the Central Committee of the People's Party in 2019.
According to Mr. HUN MANY, this report reflects the achievements and challenges of the National and Sub-National Mass Movement after his own working group met with the four movement groups in the 25 capitals. Provinces in the past.
The conference will last for two days, from December 21 to 22, 2019 at the Koh Pich Theater, and will be attended by leaders of the People's Movement Committee, members of the focal point of the People's Movement Committee in various ministries. Capital-provincial and city-district institutions throughout the country with a total of 2,700 guests.
