Authorities and officials study along the Mekong River in some districts in Kampong Cham province to take measures to prevent accidents by landslides
(Kampong Cham): The Governor of Kampong Cham Province, Mr. Un Chanda, on December 20, 2019, led a working group of professional officers from relevant departments to inspect and study river areas in Koh Sotin, Kang Meas and Srey Santhor districts of Kampong Cham province to find preventive measures. Do not let people suffer from river bank collapse next year.
