(Oddar Meanchey): The Oddar Meanchey Provincial Administration will expand the Cambodian-Thai border card application site to one more location at the O'Smach International Gate Inspection Office in Sangkat O'Smach, Samrong City, Oddar Meanchey Province. This is according to the announcement of Oddar Meanchey Provincial Administration, which was received by Fresh News on December 20, 2019.
