* First, a copy of the border card application with a photo, signature or fingerprint of the right of the applicant on the application form (the application form is provided at the application site).
* Second: Current photo of the person, size 4x6, taken in front without a hat and 2 glasses.
* Third: Khmer Nationality ID card or birth certificate or a copy of the original birth certificate or a valid copy of the original.
