No culture is better than any other, and no religion is more perfect than any other. If we take such a stand, the world will be at peace and will not cause war. But if we continue to give higher cultural values, it could lead to war. This is confirmed by Dr. Sok Touch.
The President of the Royal Academy of Cambodia stated that "Modern technology must be accepted, but there must be professional ethics, without professional ethics, technology is a tool to kill traditions, customs and religious beliefs due to the modernization of technology to make tradition "Religious traditions and beliefs will be lost, so there must be ethics."
