Senior official of the Ministry of Industry: The Royal Government has made the SME sector a priority in national policy
(Phnom Penh): Undersecretary of State at the Ministry of Industry and Handicraft, Mr. Son Seng Huot, stated that the Royal Government of Cambodia has now made the SME sector a priority in national policy.
Speaking at the opening ceremony of the seminar on the progress of the project (Task Program) Food Safety and Hygiene in Cambodia, Mr. Son Seng Huot said that the workshop organized now aims to promote the development and modernization of small and medium enterprises. Medium and handicraft in Cambodia to strengthen competition by strengthening production capacity, product quality and increase both domestic and foreign markets.
