(Kampong Chhnang): Two boys and a girl drowned while visiting a pond in the compound of Battalion 1 in Sre Ta Chey village, Aphivath commune, Teuk Phos district, Kampong Chhnang province. This incident happened on the evening of December 19, 2019.
Sources at the scene said that the two children, Sorn Phat Meng Leang, 10 years old male and Em Maria, 12 years old female, were visiting before the incident. The water above the pond then drowned, both of them could not be saved.
