(Phnom Penh): On the occasion of celebrating the 20th anniversary of the return of Macau to China, I would like to express my sincere respect to this beautiful Macau. Greatness and wish China prosperity and prosperity.
The handover of Macau to China is a great achievement in all generations of Chinese history. Since December 20, 1999, Macau has embarked on a broad path of development with China. Over the past 20 years, the "one country, two systems" policy, the Macau-Chinese Macau-Chinese political system and high-level autonomy have been fully implemented in Macau.
Under the full support of the Central Party Government and the efforts of the governments of the Macau Special Administrative Region and all levels of society, Macau has achieved remarkable achievements in development, social stability, and prosperity. The economy, harmonious living and multiculturalism are all well developed, which has become a successful model of "one country, two systems" policy.
For the future through the implementation of the Gulf Strategy of Guangdong, Hong Kong and Macau. We believe that Macau, which is like a beautiful lotus flower of China, will flourish and be even more attractive. Images of the Great Period, which show the sentiments of Macau, will also be engraved on the plaque of the Great Chinese Revival.
