On December 20, 1999, the Chinese government re-established sovereignty over Macau territory, the Macao Special Administrative Region was finally established, and entered a new era in the history of high-level autonomy. One, two systems "and the policy" Macau ruled by China Macau ".
Over the past 20 years, the "one country, two systems" policy and fundamental laws have been fully implemented, economic growth has accelerated, society has been stable and prosperous, and significant progress has been made in all areas. This demonstrates the success of implementing the "one country, two systems" policy, which is a feature of Macau to the world.
The vision for the future By incorporating Macau's deep national development strategy, the future will be brighter and more prominent, and China's "beautiful lotus" will be fragrant everywhere and the young leaves will sprout.
(Phnom Penh): The 8th round of the 8th Sea Festival in Kampot Province in 2019 is even more special than previous years, with the Inter-Ministerial Commission for Organizing the Special Festival, Sub-Committee on Sports Activities for the Sea Festival A group of Sao Linh fighters from Sao Linh Mountain, China to compete with the famous Khmer traditional martial arts team.
