The ceremony was attended by Ms. Mean Sam An, Chairman of the 8th Committee of the Senate, Chairman of the Senate Group and Vice President of the Cambodian Women's Association for Peace and Development, Ms. Men Sam An, President of the Cambodian Women's Association for Peace and Development, and Mr. Pen Kosal, Governor of Oddar Meanchey As well as leaders of civil servants in various departments and units.
Mr. Pen Kosal said that in order to implement the Royal Government's Gender Equality Policy, the provincial administration has taken care to encourage and encourage women to participate in decision-making roles from the provincial level to the grassroots level, including: Member of Provincial Council, Deputy Governor, Deputy Director of Administration to Chairman, Deputy Chief of Office and many other members of District, Commune and Sangkat Councils.
