Phnom Penh Governor Khuong Sreng said that the project to improve traffic flow in the Deer 2 area will be implemented in early 2020, as the area is facing daily traffic jams that disrupt people's travel.
According to a scientific study by students of the Institute of Technology of Cambodia, more than 53,000 vehicles pass through the Russian Federation Road every day at the intersection of two deer, while more than 50,000 vehicles pass through. Depart from Boeung Kak Lake Road, cross the Russian Federation Road, which is prone to congestion for most of the day.
