He explained some of the reasons why the traffic at the intersection of the two deer is constantly congested. "It is not good enough to cause heavy traffic congestion in front of the cabinet, so this issue must be resolved immediately."
Mr. Sam Piseth, Director of the Department of Public Works and Transport, said that the project to improve the traffic system at the intersection of the two deer can improve the traffic flow in this area by more than 40 percent, while the project is planned to spend money. To more than 1,900 million riels.
