Dr. Keo Vannak said that the provision of private health services throughout the province, including hospitals, clinics of all kinds and pharmacies, a total of 777 places.
Dr. Chhorn Mony, on behalf of the Chairman of Tbong Khmum Provincial Medical Council, called on the Director of the Office of the Director of the Hospital to take care of the unregistered doctors as soon as possible to register with the Medical Council in response. Obey the health professional law and ensure the provision of professional health services.
