It should be noted that the house of the Cambodian Veterans Association, which is a precious gift from Samdech Techo Hun Sen, was handed over to the veteran named On Sam Onn, a disabled person with a right leg living in Peam Mantea village, Peam Mantea commune, and the budget of the team was 300,000 Riels. Lots of food and supplies and sponsored 125 participants and donated 1 sarong and 10,000 Riels per person.
Another veteran, Prum Sim, both blind people living in Rong village, Cham commune, received a house and Mr. Dith Tina, the head of the Cham commune working group, donated 200,000 Riels, food and other necessities.
