So far, Kinal has not only been successful locally, but also internationally recognized. In fact, Kinal is the best-selling drug among export products, especially in Africa. Teachers and communities thank Preah Vihear Provincial Governor and Ms. Duc for announcing the construction of a school building in a remote rural school.
