(Phnom Penh): The Phnom Penh Capital Administration on December 17, 2019 announced that it will repair the dwarf loft building in Orussey Market after the dwarf lighthouse cracked.
In a statement received by Fresh News on December 17, the Phnom Penh Municipal Administration said that the construction of the long-standing O'Russey Market building is still solid. Except for the dwarf building, which is cracked and if left for a long time can cause harm to people, especially traders in the market, customers and damage to people's property.
In this announcement, the Phnom Penh Capital Administration requested all traders who are selling on the loft, under the loft and around the premises to transfer the sales temporarily to a new location outside the market to maintain security and avoid any risk. Happens eventually.
The Phnom Penh Capital Administration emphasized that the temporary transfer of sales was to make it possible for the construction technical team to repair immediately and as soon as possible so that the traders could return to their original location safely and aesthetically.
Director General of the Cambodian Chamber of Commerce: Only by working together as a whole can a company run well and grow!
(Phnom Penh): In order to share the experience to the next generation of businessmen, the Director General of the Cambodian Chamber of Commerce, Duke Nguon Meng Tech, advised business people, company owners and employees, wherever they are, to work hard together. A bundle for the company to move forward and grow. And the other is to develop the ability of their profession more regularly.
He said this at the award ceremony and prize money to the distributors of Royada Cosmetics and 27 outstanding distributors from 25 provinces on the night of December 16, 2019 at Tonle Bassac 2 Restaurant.
Duke Nguon Meng Tech praised Royada Cosmetics for its ability to strengthen itself to this day, and for its staff and distributors. He also encouraged 27 outstanding distributors and encouraged other distributors to continue their efforts to be successful.
Wu Phengkheang, CEO of Royada, said that this is the third year that the company has organized this event, this year is bigger than previous years and has 27 outstanding distributors with progress. It's moving remarkably fast as it is today, and in addition the company offers a wide range of budgets and gifts.
Meanwhile, Ms. Ouk Lida, General Director of the company, similarly said that her company has imported high quality products to compete in the local market and provide customers with beauty, most products are imported from Thailand and Korea. So far, a total of 10,000 distributors, including distributors nationwide and overseas distributors in Japan, Korea, Malaysia, and China.
She added that in the new year, the company has imported many products to circulate in the Cambodian market and provide distributors in Cambodia and abroad. And other gifts to encourage the company's distribution representatives.
Please also note that Royada is a well-known cosmetics company that is recognized by all relevant ministries as a supplier of high quality products and beauty treatments such as hair care. Maintain and treat facial skin, body lotion, armpit treatment.
