In this solemn ceremony, the presence of former teachers of Baktouk School, the principal, deputy principal, current teachers of Baktouk High School and Mr. and Mrs. former peers and many other family and friends.
This is the third time that Rath Sreang's former peers have organized this annual gathering. Lt. Gen. Rath Sreang said that parents are the first abbot who teaches their children to speak, walk, stand and dress, while teachers are the second abbot who imparts knowledge to students.
Mr. Rath Sreang claimed that in the teacher's mind, it is always the happiest to see his students strive to acquire knowledge, build dignified behavior, prepare good manners, cultivate a virtuous spirit, do only moral deeds, have a prosperous future in a righteous way. The cool light of the moon, which has always been a favorite of all human beings.
