(Kampong Cham): Mr. Un Chanda, Governor of Kampong Cham Province, after meeting with the Korean delegation on the morning of December 16, 2019 at Kampong Cham Provincial Hall, decided to organize a joint working group study to organize a model village in Kampong Cham province and improve livelihoods. People on agriculture.
