In order to ensure the effective management of tax revenue collection and to achieve the maximum plan, the General Department of Taxation will continue to strictly and effectively implement the Royal Government's in-depth reform policies and put in place Issue some of the following measures:
* Continue to cooperate with relevant units and institutions to further examine various business activities, especially in the field of fuel, sales of construction materials and tobacco production to maximize the efficiency of tax revenue, as well as take additional measures for some businesses that try Avoid paying taxes.
* Promote tax registration and update enterprise information contained in the existing management system by continuing to focus on providing good and prompt service to taxpayers and taking strict measures for fraudulent attempts or acts. Which obstructs the procedure of tax registration.
* Continue to promote the introduction of an online filing management system (E-Filing) that will facilitate the management of enterprise tax returns and assign all relevant tax officials to attend training courses in a guaranteed manner. The efficiency of using and managing this system for better results.
* Promptly update real estate and enterprise information in order to increase the efficiency of tax collection to the fullest potential, such as land and house rent tax and property tax.
* Continue to promote the management of tax debt collection to ensure the transparency of tax payments after various tax settings.
* Continue to promote and mainstream the culture of paying taxes and strengthening the implementation of tax laws.
Mr. Kong Vibol highly appreciated and expressed his deep gratitude to the leaders and tax officials at all levels in the units under the General Department of Taxation who have been actively involved in the efforts to collect good results. Well, this is a success and a common achievement of the General Department of Taxation as a whole.
