(Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, this morning, December 16, 2019, presided over the graduation ceremony for 2,588 medical students after their successful graduation. The graduation ceremony was held at the Koh Pich Convention and Exhibition Center.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that it is a pleasure that today Cambodia has more human resources in the health sector while the Royal Government is paying attention to social protection policies.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in the 198 days since the implementation, more than 100,000 women and children from poor families have received subsidies from the Royal Government.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Royal Government has already provided about 10 billion Riels to support women and children.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Royal Government has provided about 55 billion Riels for more than 100,000 maternity workers from 2018 to December 15, 2019.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the complaints of some people must be taken into consideration and the problems of doctors must be taken into account and the things raised by the people must be improved.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that it is a matter of pride for the University of Health Sciences to have evolved from a difficult situation to a progressive one as it is now.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that kidney transplants and some human organs can be safely performed at the Military Hospital or Preah Keto Mealea Hospital in Phnom Penh
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the training at the University of Health Sciences has gradually increased from year to year. Samdech Techo appreciates and thanks the leadership and professors of this university.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructed medical students and doctors to make efforts to develop their abilities, especially to respond to new diseases.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that only the Ministry of Education and Health was allowed to recruit the most staff. In 2020, the Ministry of Education will recruit 3,600 and the Ministry of Health will recruit 1,300.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen asked for the understanding of some contracted officials who always asked Samdech to get a full framework. Samdech Techo stated that it was not possible by asking to follow the rules, especially the exam.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reiterated the request for a medical examination for the Ministry of Health. Samdech Techo stated that if Samdech agrees to this proposal, it will become a nest of corruption.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded the Minister of Justice that there were complaints from the people about requesting a letter of condemnation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen requested clear management of private clinics and pharmacies.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen requested that private clinics be responsible for patients from the beginning to the end, without the need for patients to be rushed to public hospitals, especially Calmette Hospital. Samdech Techo Hun Sen asks private clinics not to take patients.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen called on all doctors with poor professional ethics to change their attitudes and words towards patients. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that there is no division in the treatment of patients.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen urges hospitals, both public and private, to take care to save the lives of the people, without taking a lot of money.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that doctors, medical students all said that they want to save people's lives before studying medicine, so why go to work and take more money than human life?
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen told medical students to pay attention to the people and patients below the poverty line.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the medical framework and teachers receive higher salaries than other frameworks. But Samdech Techo expects that the armed forces and officials of other ministries and institutions will not be jealous of doctors and teachers, because they all have children to go to school and also sick relatives need to seek medical treatment.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded doctors that patients need care very much. Samdech Techo stated that what he wanted was the doctor's ethics.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the disaster relief exercise between Cambodia and Vietnam was conducted at the request of Samdech. This exercise is not only with Vietnam, but also with Thailand and Laos.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the exercise was conducted to rescue people along the border from various disasters by the cooperation of Cambodian forces with neighboring countries.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen requested that there be no misunderstanding on the disaster relief exercise between Cambodia and Vietnam, which took place on December 18, 2019.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that this exercise is to help people not to suffer in the event of various disasters.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that on December 24, Samdech will inaugurate the Cambodia-Vietnam border market in Tbong Khmum province, which was Samdech's former battlefield in 1971.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the purpose of Samdech after launching a win-win policy to end the war is to put an end to the flames of war on the border and turn it into a trading development area.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that win-win politics is the magic medicine to end the war, unite the nation and bring about national unity.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that there is no country in the world that can end the war and bring about unification like Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Khieu Samphan was the person who insulted Samdech the most, but finally in December 1998, Khieu Samphan brought his wife and children to eat at Samdech's house, and Samdech provided a family of about $ 10,000 to Build livelihoods.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the transformation of the border area into a border of peace, friendship, cooperation and development is what he wants.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that a country can grow, have internal stability and have good relations with neighboring countries.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that it has only been 21 years since Cambodia achieved complete peace and national unity and become a poor, low-middle-income country. Without peace, without national unity, there can be no development.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen presents an international evaluation report on the Prime Minister of the world. Among them are the youngest prime minister, the oldest prime minister, the richest prime minister, the least incumbent, the longest-serving prime minister, and the longest-serving prime minister.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen ended his speech at 9:42 am on December 16, 2019. Thank you for watching the live broadcast on Fresh News TV. Senior Minister Ly Thuch thanks all CPP members who serve the people tirelessly
