TPH, a new international hospital equipped with state-of-the-art medical equipment from Germany, the United States and Japan, and a meeting of specialist doctors from Singapore, Switzerland and Canada, will open early in the first quarter of next year. The health and well-being of Cambodians, especially those who have health problems and need high-standard medical services without having to spend a lot of money and time to travel to Singapore.
