General Manager of Korean Rural Corporation Meets Agriculture Minister to Learn More About Cambodia's Agricultural Potential
On that occasion, Minister Veng Sakhon extended a warm welcome to the visiting delegation and thanked the Government as well as the Korean people for their contribution to development. Cambodia to prosper.
