Senior officials of the Ministry of Health warn that doctors must understand the problems and conditions of patients clearly
(Phnom Penh): Professor Thea Kruy, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Health, on December 13, 2019, said that doctors must understand the problems and conditions of patients to decide whether they have the ability to treat or not.
This statement was made on the occasion of Prof. Thea Kruy presiding over the opening ceremony of the 6th International Medical Conference organized by the International University (IU) in Phnom Penh on the morning of December 13, 2019. This.
Professor Thea Kruy said: "As a doctor, we need to have a clear understanding of the patient's problems and conditions in order to decide if we have a cure for this condition and whether we have the ability to treat it. "Diseases that we do not have the ability to treat and decide to send to another location that is more specialized or more likely."
At the same time, Professor Thea Kruy also pointed out that there is no law that says doctors must know how to treat all kinds of diseases, and there is no law that says doctors must treat all patients.
In addition, the senior official of the Ministry of Health said that in order to be able to practice this profession (doctor) well, all doctors must fulfill two obligations, including: 1: Must have strong skills and Update and 2: Must have a professional license as a doctor provided by the Board of Physicians, especially a valid professional license.
Professor Thea Kruy said that there is a need in the world to strengthen its professional skills, especially to keep up with the progress of medical science.
On that occasion, Prof. Thea Kruy said that the 6th International Medical Conference was organized in order to strengthen the capacity of doctors through the new understanding and new experiences of many national and international doctors.
Prof. Thea Kruy also stated that the profession as a doctor is a profession that fulfills the duties of the role of a doctor is to perform their duties with competence, strength, precision, meticulousness, caution, high discipline and spirit. Highly responsible, honest and respect the doctor's ethics is necessary. General Sao Sokha received a delegation from the Russian National Defense University.
