Khmer Breweries uses modern machines to control the quality of can lids
(Phnom Penh): Khmer Breweries' Cambodian Beer Can Capping Quality Control Machine is Fitted to Control the Accuracy of Can Capping Caps to Facilitate Packaging and Prevent Beer Spills at Sale On the market.
This machine is imported from Sweden, where the operation of the automatic control system can check the beer cans clearly and accurately according to the standards set through the use of technology.
The system will store all data to ensure that all beer cans are properly inspected for quality.
It should be noted that the machine will check the accuracy of the can mouth, both inside and outside, including checking the height of the can, the depth of the can mouth, the thickness and height of the can lid, as well as the shape of the can mouth, the can lid and the junction between the cap. To the cans and so on.
