During the discussion, the Undersecretary of State informed the meeting of the Kep Tourism Master Plan will be organized in accordance with the strategic plan and vision of the Royal Government of Cambodia, which has designated Kep as a destination for luxury tourism, which requires Focus on planning to improve the quality of services and innovative tourism products.
Mr. Ny Phally said that there is also protection for natural resources, environmental protection, solid waste management, thorough development of new tourism products and destinations, and especially the development of human resources on tourism and hospitality to ensure. Provide quality and warm tourism services, which are the key factors in attracting high-level tourists to visit Kep for a long time and again.
At the same time, during the information and data collection phase, the Undersecretary of State requested the Kep Provincial Administration, relevant specialized units and municipal administrations in the provinces to provide working groups with documents and development plans in each sector as a basis. In addition to analyzing and updating the tourism situation in Kep.
It should be noted that Kep Tourism Master Plan 2020-2023 will serve as a compass for the development of tourism in Kep province with sustainable and high competitiveness at the regional and international level to attract both quality investors and tourists. High level to Kep province. Cambodia Initiates Three New Ideas Concerning Regional Air Traffic Management Process and Reducing Air Traffic Congestion
