The scholarship program started with 10 scholarships and the number of scholarships was increased by 10 more in 2017 for students who want to continue their studies at the National Institute of Posts, Telecommunications and Information Technology (NIPTICT) through the company's contribution. Smart in the Royal Government's Capacity Development and Research Fund.
