(Siem Reap): Mr. Kittisetha Dr. Cham Prasidh, Senior Minister and Minister of Industry and Handicrafts, inaugurated the second Siem Reap Water Supply Water Treatment Plant of Siem Reap Water Supply Authority under a concession grant from the French Agency for Development (AFD). In the total amount of nearly 13 million dollars.
Mr. Kittisetha Dr. Cham Prasidh pointed out that as of 2018, the number of households receiving clean water was about 1 million households, an increase of 38% compared to 2017, which was only about 720,000 households with the amount of clean water increased to nearly 309 million. Cubic meters, up from 176 million cubic meters five years ago. In the past nine months, the water supply has reached 331 million cubic meters.
