(Ratanakkiri): The Central Forestry Administration Force, in cooperation with the Bor Keo Forestry Administration Force and the Bor Keo District Local Armed Forces, on December 11, 2019, intercepted a bus carrying heavy timber while traveling on the national road. No. 78 is located in Khlis village, Soeng commune, Bor Keo district, Ratanakkiri province.
