(Phnom Penh): Mr. Vong Soth, Minister of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation, expressed the expectation that the children who graduated from the National Institute of Social Affairs will become human resources, contribute to increase the capacity of the next generation of young people in Cambodia. Qualified human resources, achievements contribute to increase human resource capacity to another level.
