The following are the main contents of Samdech Techo Hun Sen during the graduation ceremony:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen emphasized that the interruption of the ASEAN-Republic of Korea and Mekong-Republic of Korea Summit, as well as other programs in Cambodia due to the illness of the mother-in-law.
