* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia is now far away from the situation of those who know more, teach those who know less, those who know less, teach those who do not know after the country liberated from the genocidal regime of Pol Pot.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen continues to call on educational institutions to strengthen the quality of education.
