* Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructed students not to disappoint their parents and to make efforts to further develop their abilities.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded students to use knowledge for the benefit of the nation, family and community.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that allowing the private sector to participate in the development of the education sector and allowing state universities to charge students' tuition fees is the right policy for training, which is growing every year.
