The other 2 new courses that need to be opened include: the training course for the 16th generation of senior lieutenant officers and the training course for the 6th generation of guerrilla training, with a training period of 3 months equal to 91 days. From December 1, 2019 to February 29, 2020, by studying the content of the lessons, including: Joint military, infantry tactics, infantry weapons, psychological education and guerrilla skills.
