Shipbuilding and Production Commission Releases Clarification on Criticism of World's Longest Shipkeeping
According to the statement, the public and dear journalists have recently announced the maintenance and maintenance of the world's longest ark, "Kampuchea Botta Khemaratry", which means the production and organizing committee. Show the ark to break the world record of careless maintenance.
In this case, the Commission would like to inform the public and fellow journalists as follows:
1: The Commission has often informed that the longest ark in the world will arrange the most suitable place in Prey Veng Provincial Hall for national and international guests to visit freely, and the Commission has also prepared the construction plan. Already, this project has not changed.
2: According to this year's plan, the committee plans to move the boat from the current temporary storage location to the location in the new provincial hall, but first, the construction of the provincial hall administration building is not yet completed, secondly, this year the water level in front of the provincial hall is too low soon Climb up and down quickly, such a situation is not conducive to the movement of boats out of the temporary shed.
3: The Commission would like to acknowledge that the current condition of the temporary shed reflects the roof, which is due to the flooding of the shipyard and the weather in the past, which Cambodia is under constant pressure, leading to wind and rain affecting the shipyard.
Last week, the commission decided to budget for the renovation of the shipyard, waiting for the water to recede and the ground to dry out a bit. The team will begin a complete reorganization.
The Commission considers the statement, together with some suggestions from the public and fellow journalists, to pay attention to and monitor the pain, consciously promote national achievements and national culture in the spirit of "think together, work together, take responsibility". "
(Siem Reap): Mr. Kea Boran, CEO of AMK, stated that 2019 is a year in which AMK has made significant progress as it launches its small enterprise loan products. And an average of up to $ 100,000.
