Second, the policy section includes the National Employment Policy (NEP) 2015-2025, the National Policy on Technical and Vocational Education and Training 2016-2025, the policy on labor migration for Cambodia, the Master Plan on Occupational Safety and Health. National Action Plan on the Elimination of the Most Serious Forms of Child Labor (2008-2012) and the National Plan on the Elimination of the Most Serious Forms of Child Labor (2016-2012).
