Addressing at the Dissemination and Official Launching Ceremony of "National Strategic Development Plan (NDPD) 2019-2023" on November 7, 2019, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia Concerns about electricity in Cambodia Due to Cambodia's main source of electricity, hydropower is in crisis, water shortage leads to reduced electricity generation or low power generation, especially in the dry season.
