(Phnom Penh): The world-class nutrition company Herbalife Nutrition on December 7, 2019 organized a healthy breakfast campaign at the National Olympic Stadium to promote an active lifestyle in the Kingdom of Cambodia through the presentation of exercise for health Sharing nutrition and healthy diet.
When asking customers what they consider a healthy breakfast, consumers in the Asia-Pacific region differ in that in some countries, milk is considered a healthier beverage option. Compared to coffee, in some countries soy milk is considered a healthier beverage option, while in other countries it is tea.
These different answers suggest that consumers in the Asia-Pacific region may not be fully aware of the importance of nutrition in breakfast. On the other hand, the breakfast chosen by most people in the area is low in fiber.
Despite a lack of understanding of the nutritional components of a healthy breakfast, more than 80% of consumers in the Asia-Pacific region say they want a healthier breakfast.
Please note that Herbalife Nutrition is a world-class nutrition company that aims to make the world healthier and happier. The company has continued its mission for nutrition, transforming people's lives with great nutrition programs and products since the 1980s.
