(Prey Veng): It is very sad for a family living in Prek Kamleung village, Kampong Popil commune, Pearang district, Prey Veng province, because in the blink of an eye, they lost two beloved sons due to drowning.
According to the Prey Veng provincial police, the two boys drowned at 6:10 pm on December 5, 2019 at a water hole in the ground. 8-year-old Rompheak and 5-year-old Rom Meng Chhong, both siblings, live in Prek Kamleung village, Kampong Popil commune, Pearang district.
