Mr. Mam Bunneang, Chairman of the 10th Senate Committee, made the remarks while meeting with district, commune, village and police leaders, district police, military police and district students on the occasion of the 41st anniversary of the establishment of the Front. Solidarity for the Development of the Motherland of Cambodia (December 2, 1978 - December 2, 2019) with 440 participants in Kandal Steung District, Kandal Province on November 5, 2019.
In addition, Mr. Mam Bunneang said that only December 2, January 7, January 7, the country is peaceful and development work in all fields and we all live in honor, dignity, peace, prosperity. Enjoy a wide range of freedoms, hopes and fresh smiles anytime, anywhere.
Mr. Mam Bunneang urged all Kandal Stung district authorities to do their best to provide and provide full public services to the people with good ethics, responsibility for work, respect for duties and responsibilities. Dharma can share and increase good internal unity, have a clear conscience, understand each other. In particular, the implementation of the policy of safe villages and communes, which has 9 points to be effective.
On the same day, Mr. Mam Bunneang also inspected 3 red paved roads which were completely repaired, 850 meters long and 5 meters wide, in Ta Lek village, Trapeang Veng commune, Kandal Steung district, Kandal province.
At the same time, Mr. Mam Bunneang visited and distributed gifts to 6 elderly families and patients with 200,000 Riels and 1 sarong in each family in Ta Lek village, Trapeang Veng commune, Kandal Steung district, Kandal province. Both provide funds for the repair of red gravel roads with a total budget of 20,580,000 Riels. Mobile app to buy and sell agricultural products online helps create market opportunities for farmers
Kea Boran made the remarks at a workshop on Mobile Marketing, Online Marketing for Agricultural Products Suppliers and Progress of the Tonle Sap Mobile Application on the morning of December 5, 2019.
