In order to better understand the use of the Tonle Sap App, Ms. Sok Sereyroth, Agricultural Technical Officer, gave a presentation on the use of the App, in which she indicated that the App was created to promote the sale of a variety of agricultural products to expand the market. Larger, easier for farmers and suppliers of agricultural products to register directly on the Tonle Sap mobile app vendors to sell their products.
She stated that this app is very easy to find products and services related to agriculture, can know the source of the supplier and can contact directly. A company will plant more than 30 million saplings to meet the market demand for wood in the wood processing industry
