(Phnom Penh :) Khmer Breweries Co., Ltd. has taken responsibility for the environment by installing a smoke purification system from the incinerator to be used in the production of beer and beverages for the purpose of cleaning bad fumes such as sulfur dioxide, carbon dioxide, etc. to avoid or cut Reduce emissions into the atmosphere.
