SGMC will be offering a unique new service in Cambodia: Volcanic lava therapy with a discount of only $ 60. Volcanic therapy will provide many benefits such as relieving muscle soreness and inflammation and boosting the immune system. The alkalinity of lava sand is rich in minerals, which have a high detoxifying effect.
