The fish started right! Fisheries Administration calls on people to make prahok and eat it during the fish season from today to December 9
According to the announcement of the Chonphal Administration, during the fishing season 2019-2020, after observing the water level flowing out of the Tonle Sap Lake, the water level dropped rapidly, which had never been seen before. In the past.
The water flowing out of the Tonle Sap Lake is declining so fast that the trails along the Tonle Sap River in Phnom Penh and Kandal Province can catch a lot of fish this March, from the 9th to the 13th. From the 5th to the 9th of December 2019, if the sky is clear and there is no rain.
According to the situation mentioned above, the Fisheries Administration would like to invite people who wish to make prahok, smoked fish, etc. For annual consumption, please come and buy fish in June as soon as possible at the time and place mentioned above.
At the same time, the Fisheries Administration would like to request the local authorities at all levels to make it easier for people to travel to stay and transport fish products without any obstruction.
