(Phnom Penh): The Anti-Counterfeit Products Committee, which poses a high risk to health and social safety of the Ministry of Interior, on December 4, 2019, organized a training course on "Code of Criminal Procedure and Duties and Responsibilities of Judicial Police Officers". The second time.
