Two counterfeit palm sugar handicrafts in Bati district were taken to court by CamControl officers in Takeo province
(Takeo): After raiding two fake palm sugar processing handicrafts in Komara Chea commune, Bati district, on the morning of December 4, 2019, CamControl officers in Takeo province decided to build a sensitive case. Go to court for legal action.
Mr. Por Leang Kong, Head of CamControl Branch in Takeo Province, said that some counterfeit palm sugar handicrafts in Bati district continue to produce illegally and seriously affect the identity of our Cambodian palm sugar, which is being supported by Therefore, the professional officer decided to build this case and send it to the court to deal with it according to the law without any understanding.
During the raid on two counterfeit palm sugar handicraft sites in Bati district this morning, officers confiscated equipment used to make counterfeit palm sugar, including six-year motorbikes, said CamControl. 23 pans, 20 bags of sugar, 4 cans of brown sugar and 34 empty containers. All of these materials will be burned in the near future.
