The outgoing Ambassador from Cambodia said that this win-win policy is a good lesson that other countries should learn in bringing peace, stability and development together with the harmony between the people and the people. People between religions and religions as well.
Mr. Amjad Aliser also praised Cambodia as a beautiful country to live and stay. He said he remembered what he had contributed to Cambodia and what he had gained from the experience of Cambodia during his mission in Cambodia, and that he would continue to contribute further to promoting bilateral relations between Pakistan and the United States. Cambodia to become even stronger.
