Business owners beware of wasting money! Corrupt people disguised as CamControl officers demanded money in return for not inspecting business locations
(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Commerce has called on business owners, enterprises, artisans, traders and traders across the country to be very careful because there are now crooks pretending to be CamControl officials demanding money in exchange for not inspecting business locations or helping Solve various problems.
According to the announcement of the Ministry of Commerce on December 3, 2019, said that recently, the General Department of CamControl has been carrying out the role of inspecting goods and services within the framework of direct responsibility and duties. Collaborate with relevant institutions to prevent and crack down on trade fraud, ensure the quality, safety and compliance of products, goods and services, protect the rights and interests of consumers.
This measure requires CamControl officers to inspect the locations of companies, enterprises, handicrafts, businesses and handicrafts. At the same time, some crooks have disguised themselves or used their positions as CamControl officers to extort money from company owners, enterprises, craftsmen, traders and traders in exchange for helping to solve problems or mediate any phenomena, or in exchange for non-compliance. Check and so on.
In this announcement, the Ministry of Commerce called on business owners, enterprises, artisans, traders and traders across the country to be very careful to avoid fraud and waste money.
The Ministry of Commerce has confirmed that all professional operations of the General Department of CamControl are wearing uniforms, with name tags, ID numbers and a clear mission statement.
The Ministry also appeals to business owners, enterprises, artisans, traders and traders across the country, if in doubt, please cooperate with the General Department of CamControl at the address: Concrete Road 18, Kdei Takuy Village, Sangkat Veal Sbov, Khan Chbar Ampov, Phnom Penh or call 023 231 856.
The Ministry hopes that business owners, enterprises, artisans, traders and traders will cooperate well with the General Department of CamControl to protect the interests of the private sector and the interests of the people, as well as to ensure a better business environment.
