National Bank of Cambodia Quick Payment Service Officially Launched with Prince Bank
(Phnom Penh): Prince Bank has partnered with commercial banks and other Deposit-Taking Financial Institutions (MDIs) to provide a “Quick Payment Service” developed by the National Bank of Cambodia, which allows Prince Bank customers to Transfer money to all member financial institutions quickly and securely.
This money transfer transaction is carried out in real time and money can be received immediately, and this fast payment service promotes interbank cooperation that facilitates the transfer of KHR across the country. In addition, customers can get many benefits from the maximum remittance up to 40 million Riel, while the fee for remittance service is as low as 4,000 Riel.
This move towards digital is in line with Prince Bank's long-term vision of becoming a leading digital bank, to celebrate the launch of "Quick Payment Services" and to enhance operations Transfer money in KHR at all branches of Prince Bank, the transfer fee is free. Customers can get this benefit from today until June 30, 2020.
